 "contract": "The spell's completion. The FF31C0 anchor: 7B42 (SUBQ.W #1,+10; BPL) with 13294 on a negative result (FF0B90 = 0001, FF0B92 = 0006, FF0B94 = 0000, FF0EDE cleared, FF0B98/9C/A0 = 135EA; FF0B96 kept) and the 7B4E store +16 = 7B58; 7B58 returns while FF0B90 is nonzero, else +46(A5) = D269 (\"SPELL COMPLETED! / DOOR OPEN!\", priority 01) through CB72, A6 saved around BSR 7E18, JSR 1324E and +16 = 7B8A; 7B8A returns while FF0B90 is nonzero, else +16 = 12646. 7E18: the FF31AC and FF31B0 objects' fruit (+08 - 0260) / 6 (DIVU.W quotient) stored in FF31C4/FF31C6; 7ED6 on each (mode 0; with FF31A8 zero the +42 record's object is cleared and its FF312C entry set to FFFF; the FF31A8 path at 7EF4 is outside scope); FF31A8, FF31B0 and FF31AC cleared; the first 83DA entry naming the pair in either order selects sound 9C (FCB32), JSR (A2) and JSR 95EE; no entry branches to 9288. Only recipe 8652 (fruits 6 and 5) is reconstructed: FF316C nonzero branches to 9182; otherwise 7F08 allocates the sparkle (F9E2: mode 80, frame 021D, (FF0690+3C, +3E + 28), extents 0010/0010, handler 7F6A, +10 = 0040, sound 90), FF316C = FFFF and 6F02 allocates two objects (the lower: F9E2 defaults at (0,0); the higher, the door: +36 the lower, (FF0690+3C - 8, +3E + 24), frame 021D, +10 = 001E, handler 6FB6, +4A = FF0690; FF316E = the door; FF33E2 set branches to 6F44). 95EE with FF31A6 or FF31A4 set calls 9682 or 9614. 7F6A: +10 - 1; negative releases (JMP FAA4); else E918, and when its low byte is at most 73 two E918 offsets ((r & 1F) - 10, Y then X), 5A9A and a fourth E918 whose bit 0 sets the particle's +12 = 4000. 6FB6: +10 - 1; negative runs 5964 and +1A = 6FCA. 6FCA: sound 95, +2 + 8, +4 - 8, frames 00B0/00A8/00B7, +0C/+0D = 3, extents 0010/0020, mode 81, +46 = 705C, +16 = 12646, then 4C08 on the +36 object (mode 80, (x, y - 24), +6 = FF0690+3A, handler 4C34, +22 = 4C52), door +3A = it and its +6 = 00D2. 4C34 adds the next 4C52 word to +4, wrapping after fourteen. 705C: AC5E with FF0690; a contact (7082) and FF33E2 set (7072) are outside scope. Natively SpellCountdown/step_spell_countdown, MixedPool::complete_spell, SpellSparkle, ExitDoor and DoorSign (src/sim/spell.*) and start_spell_fade_out."
